    <string name="health_atlas_distribution_scope">Teaching model: 100% starts in the central compartment. Exchange is bidirectional; elimination occurs only from the central compartment. These compartments group kinetic behavior, not individual organs. Amounts are percentages of the initial total, not concentrations or drug effects.</string>
